  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_dye_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>Compounds generally made up of complex organic materials that dissolve or are suspended in a liquid that absorbs into and colors another material. Distinguished from pigments, which are insoluble in the vehicle, but instead are held in a suspension. [Source: Getty AAT]</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
